  "content": "[Intro]\n[E]\nWell\n\n[Verse 1]\n[E]take me back down where cool\nwater flows y'all\nAh\nlet me remember things\nI love now\nStoppin' at the log where cat-\nfish bit\n[C]Walkin' along the river\nroad at night\n[A]Barefoot girls danc-\nin' in the moonlight\n[E7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E]I can hear the bull-frog\ncallin' me how\nWonderin' if my rope's still\nhangin' to the tree\nLove to kick my feet way down\nthe shallow water, Ah\n[C]shoe-fly dragon fly get\nback t'your mother\n[A]Pick up a flat rock skip\nit across Green\n[E7]River\n\n[Solo 1]\n[E]\n[C]\n[A]\n[E7]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[E]Up at Cody's camp I spent\nmy days y'all,\nWith flat car riders and\ncross tie walkers\nOld\nCody Junior took\nme over\n[C]Said you're gonna find the world\nis smouldrin' And\n[A]if you get a lost\ncome on home to Green\n[E7]River\n\n[Solo 2]\n[E]",
